# Shell scripts are executed inside the Linux container. A CRLF checkout there
# fails with `$'\r': command not found` before the first real line runs, so the
# line ending is a correctness property, not formatting — pin it here rather than
# relying on each committer's core.autocrlf. This repo is developed on Windows
# (autocrlf=true), which is exactly the setup that stages CR bytes into a script
# nobody notices until it reaches a server.
*.sh text eol=lf
